{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17999","headline":"杏花 · 韩愈","name":"杏花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"居邻北郭古寺空，杏花两株能白红。\n曲江满园不可到，看此宁避雨与风。\n二年流窜出岭外，所见草木多异同。\n冬寒不严地恒泄，阳气发乱无全功。\n浮花浪蘂镇长有，才开还落瘴雾中。\n山榴踯躅少意思，照耀黄紫徒爲丛。\n鹧鸪钩輈猿呌歇，杳杳深谷攒青枫。\n岂如此树一来翫，若在京国情何穷。\n今旦胡爲忽惆怅，万片飘泊随西东。\n明年更发应更好，道人莫忘邻家翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17999.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17999","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}